Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:09.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我提议继续坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I say we continue to insist
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:13.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教会特权不受世俗的干扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon the church's immunity from secular interference;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:15.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我们会坚持下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we shall continue to insist upon it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:17.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为这一豁免权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because that immunity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:20.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我主授予的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was ordained by god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:24.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且这一教会特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this immunity from secular interference should extend
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:28.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也应由教会的神父和教工享有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the ordained priests and servants of our holy church
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:31.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们应该免受谋杀等伤害的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they should be free from the threat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:35.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论是下毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of murder and harm,by the use of poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:41.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是其他恶毒的方式 这些信徒唯一的"罪孽"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or any other foul means,when their only crime
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无非是遵从了上帝的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has been to obey god's law
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:47.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维护了教会的圣洁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And uphold the sanctity of the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:52.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳请大家理解…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:55.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王肯定不会允许这种事情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the king can't allow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:57.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}投票至关重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The vote is crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.73,0:03:00.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何 他都会粉碎教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One way or another,he must break the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:03.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从现在 到永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now and for always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:29.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你好 马克 - 这到底是怎么了 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- hey,mark. - what is this,mr. wyatt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是圣诞节 温馨的节日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's christmas! the season of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:34.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家都怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's wrong with everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:35.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今年一切都不同往日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no mirth this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 所以没什么气氛 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- because everything is different. - how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道你注意到没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in case you hadn't noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:40.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后和她的婢女都不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the queen and her ladies aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:43.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们就该不开心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why should we all be sad about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如法国人所说 没有王后的后宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know the Franch say A court without ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:50.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像花园没有了鲜花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is like a garden without flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:53.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮夫人 您的圣诞礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady anne,a christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:55.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thank you,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:07.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还为你订制了一张很舒服的床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've also had a great bed made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:09.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就要做好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:12.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 来自安妮夫人的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,a present from the lady anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}猎矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boar spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:25.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很显然 是比斯开(西班牙地名)风格的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}made after the biscayan fashion,apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:30.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是最上乘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:45.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:47.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一件礼物 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}another present for your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:54.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:05:00.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很精致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's very fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:02.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谁送的？- 王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Who sent it to me? - her majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后 国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Queen katherine,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:11.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不接受 拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not receive it. take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别让她扫了雅兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't let her spoil everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:26.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 首相托马斯·莫尔爵士觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your majesty,the chancellor sir thomas more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:31.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sir thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:35.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 安妮女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}majesty. mistress anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:37.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我带来一份很合时宜的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a seasonal gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请恩准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:51.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它提醒我们这个节日的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It reminds us of what we have to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:56.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 托马斯爵士 我会珍惜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thank you,sir thomas. I will treasure this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要尽早会面 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must meet soon,thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们还有很多国事要商讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a great deal to do with the business of management of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:06.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于教会滥用特权的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's still a great clamour against the privileges
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.57,0:06:09.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有很多争论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enjoyed by the clergy,and their abuse of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:12.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必定还要采取进一步措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Further measures will certainly have to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}期待与您探讨 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I look forward to consulting with your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:47.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- your majesty. - charles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- majesty. - happy christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:56.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 打网球吗？- 好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- game of tennis? - good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:59.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 有件事不知该不该说 - 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- May I speak with you honestly? - I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:03.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不是一定要娶波林女士 不计后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you really gonna marry mistress boleyn? whatever the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不计前嫌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever her history?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯 你问这个什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why do you ask,charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:12.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不计前嫌是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what do you mean "whatever her history?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:19.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有确信的消息她和托马斯·怀特曾经有私情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have it on very good authority that she and thomas wyatt were once lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然她与托马斯经常私通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently she fornicated with him on many occasions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:24.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时夜里偷偷溜到他的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes brazenly entering his chambers at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:28.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说过 她否认了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've heard those rumours. she denies it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:30.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 她当然会否认了 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well,she would,wouldn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:34.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说了 她说没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said she denies it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:46.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得国王怎么样 克朗默先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how do you find the king,mr. cranmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向您起誓 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to you,mr. cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他真的是最善良的王公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he really is the kindest of princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:52.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得你遇到了一个大好的机遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you were born at a happy hour
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为目前看来 你的言行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For it seems,do or say what you will,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:57.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下都会支持的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty will always take it at your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:58.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am not so conceited
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:02.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上我只是陛下的一个勤恳的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As to suppose I am anything more to his majesty than a diligent servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:04.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谦虚为你赢得荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your modesty does you honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:06.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是国王陛下很明显认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But his majesty clearly thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:08.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定可以胜任更高的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you are destined for better things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此他任命你为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which is why he has appointed you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}派驻神圣罗马帝国的特使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His special envoy to the court of the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不可能这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he can't possibly do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:24.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的意思是… 是说… 为什么选我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What... what I mean is... is,why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个无名小卒 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I... I am nothing,mr. cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:30.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下非常信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his majesty trusts you absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道你比任何人都了解他要事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He knows that you understand his great matter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:35.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为陛下的代言人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Better than anyone else,and that you take his part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:39.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最好尽力在皇宫代表他的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd better place the most to represent him at the imperial court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你会非常成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure that you'll be a great success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:48.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去皇宫的路上 可去纽伦堡转转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And on your way there,you'll have a chance to visit the city of nornberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:51.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是首个完全由路德教派和改良派管理的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first city wholly run by lutherans and reformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:54.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一座既没有狂热迷信和盲目崇拜的信徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A city free of ancient superstitions and idolatry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:58.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没有罗马教会和滥用特权的牧师的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Free of popery and the abuses of the clergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很期待读读你的记述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall look forward to your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:10.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克伯爵也来跟我提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The duke of suffolk has taken it upon himself to repeat the gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:12.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些关于你和怀特先生的谣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About you and mr. wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and do you believe any of it to be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:20.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我相信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就不会在这跟你散步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would I be walking here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:34.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:37.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该已经把他驱逐出宫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've banished the duke from court?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:25.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我召唤了法国大使来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've asked the french ambassador to come and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:28.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要他重新起草一份与法国的盟约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want him to draw up a new treaty of alliance with france.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:31.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以转移教皇的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To nullify the threat against the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:35.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}挺好的 你知道我对法国情有独钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm glad. you know my sentiments towards france.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:37.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是 冒昧的问…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But,forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:40.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这跟我有什么关系？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has that got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见他还有另外一个原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is another reason why I want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:47.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想安排我们一起访问法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I intend to arrange a visit to france for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:51.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想正式向法国国王弗兰西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to present you,formally,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:54.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}介绍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To king francis,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:56.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为我未来的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But as my future wife
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:58.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}及未来的英格兰王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the future queen of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:04.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh,my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:33.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 跟你说句话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your grace. may we speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:43.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为坎特伯雷大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am here to inform your grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来这里是告知您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As archbishop of canterbury,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王打算在国会下一次议会之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the king intends to put a bill
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提出一个新的议案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before the new session of parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:52.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于什么 克伦威尔先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what does it concern,mr. cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:53.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}议案旨在否认罗马教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it means to deny the pope
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:57.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及教皇从收取从英国教会征收的赋税\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}much of the revenue he now receives from the english church.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时提案反对我国重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It also means to lay indictments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:04.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 神职人员的特权 - 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Against the privileges of leading clergy in this country. - Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:08.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这针对神圣教堂的进一步攻击原因何在？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What could be the cause of this further attack upon our holy church?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人们会亲眼看见修道士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}People can see for themselves that the monasteries
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经坐拥大笔财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are already sitting on a great wealth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些财富本应用在别处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which could be better applied elsewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本应给那些普通善良的劳动者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the good of the whole commonwealth. for the good of ordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:18.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带来福利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hard-working people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:20.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对滥用权力的抨击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This does not strike me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:23.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我来说并不可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As an attack against abuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:26.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这公开的攻击更是针对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But rather,an open attack
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:28.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon our faith...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:32.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对祖先的信仰 …\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the faith of our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人可以这样判断 可我并不这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that is your judgement,your grace,it is not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:39.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither is it the king's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 有事吗 夫人？- 替我准备洗澡水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes,madam? - Draw me a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:56.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 散步让我有些冷了 - 好的 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- The walk has made me cold. - Yes,madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:59.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got such exciting news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要去巴黎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're going to paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:04.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将被引见给国王 南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to be presented before the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:30.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天谁来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who has been in the apartment today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:34.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人来过 夫人 我并不知情 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody,Madam. Not to my knowledge. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这儿有个预言牌阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here is a book of prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:46.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是王后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:49.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this is myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头被砍下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With my head cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:16.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His grace the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:23.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我已经得到陛下的谕令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace. I have his majesty's order
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你逐出宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To banish you from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.52,0:14:30.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好像冒犯龙颜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have displeased him,it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你究竟是何方神圣 克伦威尔先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you,Mr. Cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:39.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得我应该认识你 可事实并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel like I should know,but somehow I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:43.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就如同你所了解到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am exactly as your grace finds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:47.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我尽全力侍奉陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I serve his majesty to the best of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:50.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人告诉我你曾经是个雇佣兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some one told me that you were once a mercenary soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:53.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我年轻时是做了些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw some action in my youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:56.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像大人一样 我确信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As did your grace,I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:15:00.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不是逢迎的军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I was never a soldier of fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:02.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果冒犯国王 也是出于忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I displeased the king,it was in a good cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:07.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 虽然有些人会有异议 - 比如你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Although some would argue otherwise. - Like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不敢与你争执 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would never have the temerity to argue With your grace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是不当着我的面罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to my face anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:18.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是陛下的命令 你必须立刻离宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here is the order. You are to leave court at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:36.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我拿着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have here,in my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是在授职仪式上所有神职人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The oath which all members of the clergy swear to the pope
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:43.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对教皇的誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the time of their consecration!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:46.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他们对我们誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is in clean contrast
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:49.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝然不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the oath they swear to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:16:00.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的臣子们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My beloved subjects...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:02.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们原以为神职人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We thought the clergy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是完全服从于我们的臣子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were wholly our subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:09.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在我们明白他们半心半意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now we can see they are only half our subjects...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:12.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他们还是我的臣民的话 诸位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they are our subjects at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:31.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要知道你们到底听命于谁？教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I demand to know whose subjects are you,the pope's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:35.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:55.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 乔治·索科莫图爵士光临 - 乔治·索科莫图爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Sir George Throckmorton,your honour. - Sir george!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:57.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:01.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你是位虔诚的天主教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you are a good catholic man
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从不怕凭良心说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who has never been afraid to speak his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:07.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么说真的 所有人都该如此吗 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So,in truth,should every man,your honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:10.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 但这阵子 似乎有有许多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed. But these days,it seems there are many
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:14.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被打压的不敢说话 更糟的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who can be bullied into silence,or worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:17.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}竟然违背他们的良心做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to acting against their conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:20.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记住我的话 乔治 接下来的几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mark my words,George,these next few days
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:24.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将决定我们信仰的未来命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will determine the future of our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.55,0:17:26.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论克伦威尔先生说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever Mr. Cromwell says,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:30.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论他怎么矫饰他的言辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}However he dresses his argument up with honeyed words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:32.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果都是一样的 他决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The effects remains the same.He is demanding
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:36.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要让所有神职人员都服从国王的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the clergy submit themselves totally to the king's will and to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:37.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和世俗的权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}secular authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿上帝阻止他不让他成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God forbid he should ever succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:42.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他成功了 就不会有教堂 不会有宗教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he does,there will be no more church,no more religion,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:46.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这王国将不再有精神生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No more spiritual life in this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:49.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔或许还会玷污圣母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cromwell might as well rape the blessed virgin himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.39,0:17:50.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your honour!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:53.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此我请求你 请求像你一样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's why I'm asking you,asking you and people like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:59.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保持力量 坚守真理 如果你们这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To remain strong and true. If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:02.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会得到上帝巨大的回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you will deserve god's great reward,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:07.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自己也会获得更多的敬拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And much worship will come to you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:12.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到那时甚至连国王都会感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In time even the king himself will thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We give thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:17.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王圣权的恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the reign of the king's grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:19.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们请求上帝保佑吾王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we ask god's blessing on him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:22.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他的臣民…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And on his people...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.27,0:18:26.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但在这个神圣的日子 我们有必要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But on this holy day,we are obliged to say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:30.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下的有些传教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That some of your highness's preachers are these days
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:33.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像我们在亚哈王统治时"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too much like those of Ahab's days,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所看到的那些信口雌黄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In whose mouths was found
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:37.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有着虚伪和狡诈的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A false and lying spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:42.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些传教士拥有的 是虚假的福音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Theirs is the gospel of untruth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:46.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们甚至推崇国王的特权和自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not afraid to tell of licence and liberty for monarchs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是任何一个信奉主的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which no christian king should dare
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:52.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从不敢冒犯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even to contemplate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳请殿下留心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beseech your highness to take heed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:58.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别再走你们所在的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to pursue the path you seem to be taking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:01.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然你们一定会成为下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or you will surely follow Ahab,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:03.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迎娶了青楼婊子的亚哈王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who married the whore jezebel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:07.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们的下场也会和他一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And surely will incur his unhappy end,that dogs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:09.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}狗会像舔尽亚哈王的血一样舔食你们那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will lick your blood as they licked Ahab's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:12.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为上帝所避讳和禁锢的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which God avert and forbid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:15.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放手 你们这些走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unhand me,you dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:19.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是上帝的使徒 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a man of God! Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:20.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:31.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是上帝的使徒 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a man of God! Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:35.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这无耻的托钵僧 如果不马上闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shameless friar! You'll be sewn in a sack
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:39.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会被缝进袋子 然后被丢进泰晤士河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And thrown into the thames if you don't speedily hold your tongue
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:42.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}省省吧 这只能吓吓你的走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep your threats for your fellow courtiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:44.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们托钵僧不会在意你的那些话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As for us friars,we take no account of them at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:46.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我们知道 如同存在于大地一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since we know very well that the way to heaven is as good
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:49.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天堂之路也在水中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by water as by land.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:01.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王驾到 全体起立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All rise for the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:26.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Parliament is in session!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:35.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:38.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your graces...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:41.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们决定了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you come to a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.89,0:20:44.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是依然反对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you still deny me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:46.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or do you accept
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:50.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们国王的权威？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The authority of your king?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:22.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 这是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty. here is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:25.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}神职人员…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The submission of the clergy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:28.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对陛下的绝对服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To your majesty's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:36.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谢谢你 大主教 - 他们已经投降了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thank you,archbishop. - They've surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:39.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教会已经被瓦解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The church is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没想过在我有生之年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never thought I would live
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:46.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能看到英格兰的这一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To see this day in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 国会的行动给予了异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,by act of parliament,heretics are free
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:53.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在伦敦不受检查 自由来往的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To swan around the streets of london without check.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:55.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果可以哭泣 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I could weep,Sir Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.57,0:21:58.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将流出血泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would weep tears of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:10.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas More.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.38,0:22:21.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:23.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:32.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来是要辞去首相的职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come to offer my resignation from my post as chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请求您能准许我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask your highness to allow me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:38.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从公众生活中抽身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To withdraw from public life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:41.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我能有更多的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that I may spend what time remains to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充实我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Provisioning my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:45.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽职与上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in the service of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:52.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这袋里装着代表我职权的印章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In this bag I carry the great seal of my office,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:56.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我已无力拿起它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which I find now too heavy to hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:21.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我十分欣慰的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I discharge you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:24.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解除你的职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:28.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士 在你为我供职期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In everything you have done for me,sir thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.71,0:23:30.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have always...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:34.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽职 高尚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Been good and gracious,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.59,0:23:36.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管是在私人生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Both in private
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:43.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 还是在公共事务中 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And in public affairs. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.67,0:23:47.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以我的荣誉担保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promise on my honour
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:49.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决不会在公共场合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I will never speak publicly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:52.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提及陛下的要事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of your majesty's great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.96,0:23:57.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是现在 以私人的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now,in private,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.37,0:23:59.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为一个曾受陛下信任的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must confess to you, as someone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.47,0:24:02.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须要承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who once enjoyed your majesty's confidence and friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:05.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我深深地相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My deepest belief that, if your majesty saw fit
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.24,0:24:07.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果陛下能与凯瑟琳王后和解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be reconciled with queen katherine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.52,0:24:11.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那您王国所经历的分裂和遭受的创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The divisions and hurts of your kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.85,0:24:13.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将马上得到治愈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would at once be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.50,0:24:23.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我想说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There. I've said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:30.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从此我将不再开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now my lips are forever sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.35,0:24:32.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.95,0:24:37.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你坚守对我的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will hold you to that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:05.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫尔宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The More
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.56,0:25:08.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白女士 我受陛下之命前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lady elizabeth. I come on the king's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:10.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mr. wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.53,0:25:13.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳夫人在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where is the lady katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.65,0:25:16.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下在做祷告 将要有一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her majesty is at prayer and will be for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.86,0:25:18.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能打扰她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She cannot be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.19,0:25:21.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我受命前来送这个 - 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I am charged to deliver this. - what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.15,0:25:24.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收回凯瑟琳女士王室珠宝的谕令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a command that lady katherine return her official jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:37.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白女士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady elizabeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.67,0:25:43.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你想要什么 - 你知道我想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- what do you want? - you know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.74,0:25:49.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怀特先生 我从没兴趣成为你的情人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mr. wyatt,i have no intention of becoming your mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:51.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不想成为任何人的情人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor anyone else's, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:56.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在结婚时必须是个处女 但我怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be a virgin when I marry,but I doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.15,0:25:57.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自己是不是会结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall marry at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许做个虔诚的信徒更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rather be a bride of christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:02.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}修女？我可不那么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a nun? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.82,0:26:08.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看你的口袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.59,0:26:36.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"上帝您是否知晓我内心深处的渴望…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"would god thou knewest the depth of my desire...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.45,0:26:40.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我是否能够期望 即使我根本不配…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"then might I hope,thou nought I can deserve...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:44.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拥有一些平息我炙热的欲望之火的恩泽"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some drops of grace would quench my scorching fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.21,0:26:59.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我法国之旅的所有事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust all the arrangements
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.47,0:27:02.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 都已经安排好了吧？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Have been made for my visit to france? - yes,everything is prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.86,0:27:04.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都准备好了陛下 弗兰西斯国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And ready,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.52,0:27:07.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分期待与您的再次会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}king francis Is most eager to see your majesty again,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:11.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及共同签订一份友好联盟协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to sign with you a new alliance of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.10,0:27:13.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮女士怎么样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the lady anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.56,0:27:16.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她将会受到最高的待遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she will be received with all due honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:18.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很高兴你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.69,0:27:20.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只想把最好的给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only want the best for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.21,0:27:24.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望这是一次特别之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want this visit to be special.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.44,0:27:26.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不希望有任何人来破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I don't want anything to spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.55,0:27:29.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:31.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 完全明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand. completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.39,0:27:34.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法兰西国王也明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so does his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:52.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯米顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thank you,mr. smeaton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:27:58.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.54,0:28:03.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下这就是我和您提过的年青绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty this is the young gentlemen I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.30,0:28:06.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 马克·斯米顿 - 斯米顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mark smeaton. - mr. smeaton.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:08.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮女士和我提过很多你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lady anne has told me a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.24,0:28:11.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说你很会演奏音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She says you play very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.09,0:28:13.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我们演奏些什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Play something for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.03,0:28:15.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵旨 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.44,0:28:52.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道沙福克公爵口不择言是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know it was wrong for the duke of suffolk to say what he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.35,0:28:55.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你觉得我们是否可以饶恕他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But do you think it's possible we could forgive him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.92,0:28:58.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你这么快就饶恕了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you forgave him so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:02.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人会认为他说的是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some people might think that there was some truth To what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:04.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不错 但为了驳倒他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes,but to refute them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.09,0:29:06.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了能正面的回答这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To answer the matter directly
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.69,0:29:07.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证明我有多信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to show how much I trust you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.04,0:29:10.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有更大的举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will do a more important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:15.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会邀请怀特先生与我们同去法兰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will invite mr. wyatt to come to france with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:18.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样就没人会说我嫉妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That way,no one can accuse me of jealousy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.55,0:29:20.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们一点也不会怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or the slightest suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.06,0:29:26.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 他们没有理由怀疑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my love,you have no reason to be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.85,0:29:30.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以后也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor will ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.96,0:29:41.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从我们的朋友克朗默那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've received a most illuminating letter
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:43.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收到一份非常有启发的信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from our friend cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.31,0:29:46.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像在纽伦堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It appears that,in nuremberg,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.38,0:29:48.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}神职人员是允许结婚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clergy are allowed to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.93,0:29:51.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克朗默先生充分利用了这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And mr. cranmer has taken full advantage of that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.91,0:29:55.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你说他结婚了？- 看上去是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- you mean he got married? - so it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:59.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对他的事业没什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well,it won't do his career much good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:00.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非法结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Being illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:06.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不错 神职人员结婚现在是违法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well,it's illegal for the clergy to marry now,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.49,0:30:10.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.51,0:30:14.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想让牧师可以结婚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want priests to be able to marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.97,0:30:20.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我还没向你解释清楚 勋爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}perhaps I have never fully explained myself to you, your lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:26.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我对你们攻击时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When,to you and to others, I have attacked the practices
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.63,0:30:28.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们的天主教堂活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of the catholic church
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.69,0:30:32.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朝拜 对圣人的崇拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pilgrimages and the worshipping of saints,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.47,0:30:34.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向十字架匍匐顶礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crawling to the cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.92,0:30:37.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对牧师的尊敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Veneration of priests...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.87,0:30:41.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没有兴趣对他们进行改革\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never been interested in reforming them. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.21,0:30:47.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真正的 唯一的兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My real, my only interest
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.88,0:30:50.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在于毁灭他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is in destroying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正好相反 秘书官现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the contrary, mr. secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.66,0:31:01.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为我们都很非常了解对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think we understand each other perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.99,0:31:21.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.84,0:31:24.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一件非常重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something very important, which must be done
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:26.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须再去法兰西之前解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before we can sail for france.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:29.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.45,0:31:32.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.06,0:31:39.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让路 为安妮女士让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way for the lady anne. make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.81,0:32:14.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昭告天下所有人等 贵族们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To all and singular,as well nobles and gentiles as others.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.69,0:32:18.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及出席的各位大人们 我王龙颜大悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To whom these presents shall come,it is the king's pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:19.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钦此爵位封授状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by this patent,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:22.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}授予安妮·波林女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To confer on the lady anne boleyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.72,0:32:25.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其本人及其子嗣后裔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In her own right, and on her offspring,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.07,0:32:30.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世袭彭布罗克女侯爵的贵族头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The noble title of marquess of pembroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.50,0:32:32.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据此封授状 另赐领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And also by this patent, to grant her lands
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.98,0:32:35.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年收入10万英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Worth 100,000 pounds a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.40,0:32:39.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以维护她的尊贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the maintaining of her dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:44.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的爵位封授状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the patent of your nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.70,0:33:46.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thank you,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.06,0:34:08.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty the king
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.86,0:34:12.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及彭布罗克女侯爵安妮·波林女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the lady anne boleyn, Marquess of pembroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.70,0:34:31.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主耶稣基督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Corpus domini nostri jesu christi
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.41,0:34:36.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿您的圣体保佑获得永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Custodiat tu in vitam aeternam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.59,0:34:42.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们深爱的渥兰大教主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our dearly beloved archbishop warham.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.54,0:34:44.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已平静地离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he died peacefully...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.14,0:34:47.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果要在此刻说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If one can say such a thing at such a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:52.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也许 幸运地正在通往天堂之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he is,perhaps,fortunate to be gathered now into heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.57,0:34:55.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他深爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before the final ruin
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.47,0:34:57.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并一直服务的教会被毁之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of the church he loved and served.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.91,0:35:01.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你辞职了 托马斯爵士 因为这场灾难？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are resigned then, sir thomas,to our ruin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.84,0:35:03.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道还能做些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what else can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.19,0:35:07.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们挺身迎战却失败而归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We fought,and we failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.85,0:35:12.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在只想平静地离开这是非之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I want now is to be left in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.34,0:35:15.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进行我的写作和祷告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To write and pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.05,0:35:19.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我们仍有责任为了天主教的利益而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}surely we have a duty still to act in the interests of christendom,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.91,0:35:21.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论要付出什么代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.28,0:35:23.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不惧怕代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no fear of the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.27,0:35:27.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是我已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.03,0:35:29.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发誓远离尘世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Abjured the public realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.51,0:35:31.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它不再吸引我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It no longer interests me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.43,0:35:37.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像它再也不会吸引主教大人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As it no longer interests his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.92,0:36:02.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达瑞尔夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mistress darrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.81,0:36:07.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来还你的诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came to give you your poem back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.80,0:36:15.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能把诗退回来 就像不能退一个吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you cannot give a poem back. or a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.21,0:36:17.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者一个想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:21.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不开心我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry that you are unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.73,0:36:25.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像被燃烧着 如你所说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Burning,as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.46,0:36:30.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 但这和我没有一点关系 - 没关系？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm sure I've done nothing to cause it. - nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.21,0:36:33.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的小姐 你正是这一切之因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lady,you are full of causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.47,0:36:38.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的头发…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.07,0:36:40.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的眼睛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.90,0:36:45.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的双唇…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your lips...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:47.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有这些都是我渴望之源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All are causes of my desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.12,0:37:02.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须要回去做事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must go to mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.98,0:37:05.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you must. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.17,0:37:08.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就再待一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.01,0:37:56.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.02,0:37:58.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Giving you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.62,0:38:00.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来赎罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be penitent...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.63,0:38:03.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我美丽的 虔诚的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My beautiful,pious lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.94,0:38:25.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛格丽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}margaret,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.31,0:38:28.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Darling daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.17,0:38:31.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可能将要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It might come to pass
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.85,0:38:34.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我的信仰付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I could be held to account for my beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.09,0:38:38.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是国王同意你为你的良知说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the king allows for your conscience...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.35,0:38:40.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管如何我们还是有所准备的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nonetheless,it's better to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:42.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.01,0:38:45.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sweetheart...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.56,0:38:50.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须讨论我殉道的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must discuss the question of martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.72,0:38:54.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.22,0:38:55.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.17,0:38:59.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我觉得如果我的妻儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because if I thought my wife and children
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.21,0:39:02.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能鼓励我为了正义的事业而牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would encourage me to die in a good cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.85,0:39:05.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会感到很欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would so comfort me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.66,0:39:07.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于这种快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That in great joy I would
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.83,0:39:10.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会含笑九泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Merrily run to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.99,0:39:12.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.49,0:39:14.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.01,0:39:20.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh,father!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.13,0:39:32.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.29,0:39:35.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些服饰都是法国流行的款式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are all in the french fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.07,0:39:39.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是您赐给我的锦缎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the damask you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.38,0:39:47.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.07,0:39:50.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我要你为我骄傲 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I so want you to be proud of me! - oh,i will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.59,0:39:53.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些会为你增光添彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And these will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.51,0:40:14.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰王后佩戴的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are the jewels of the queens of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.38,0:40:17.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我重新为你准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall have them reset for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:28.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的心情难以言表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.80,0:40:31.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当然知道如何表达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes,you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:42.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.64,0:40:47.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时时刻刻恋着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you with my every breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.44,0:40:49.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深爱着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With every fibre of my being.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.66,0:40:52.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你 我属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you and I am yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.59,0:41:01.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我也属于你 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- and I am yours. - wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.12,0:41:07.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直对我关爱有加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been so kind to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.82,0:41:17.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 让我来服侍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me be kind to you. my love...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.18,0:41:26.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My love...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.06,0:42:11.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你要与国王一同前往法国？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- you are travelling with the king to france? - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.56,0:42:14.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否考虑在抵达之后执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will you consider carrying out your mission while you are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.37,0:42:16.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 机会千载难逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's a good opportunity. yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.97,0:42:20.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你成功暗杀国王的妓女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you succeed in killing the king's whore,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.01,0:42:23.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将受到上帝的恩泽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be the beloved of god,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.40,0:42:26.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到教皇和神圣罗马皇帝陛下的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of his holiness, and of the emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.40,0:42:29.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为虔诚的英格兰人民所爱戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And truly of all the faithful people of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.69,0:42:32.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我在行刺中遭遇不测怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if I should die in the attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.01,0:42:36.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下会负责照顾你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then the emperor would look after your family here on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.31,0:42:39.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而天堂大门将为你敞开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you would be welcomed into heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.74,0:42:41.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受到天使的热烈欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By a fanfare of angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.05,0:42:57.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英侵法领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}English Occupied France
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.24,0:43:18.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最亲爱的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my dearest brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.26,0:43:23.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的兄弟 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mon fr猫re. mon ami.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.15,0:43:27.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bienvenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.63,0:43:33.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们此行的目的是重修我们的友谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are here to renew our friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:36.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及两国的邦交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that of our two nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.37,0:43:40.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 我们为此庆祝一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come! let us celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.51,0:43:46.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For health.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.65,0:43:56.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是场令人愉快的盛宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a wonderful feast, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.63,0:43:59.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 - 但是… 她在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- merci - but... where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.15,0:44:03.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮夫人在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is the lady anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.71,0:44:05.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she will be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.82,0:44:09.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 我妻子和妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sorry my wife and sister
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.32,0:44:11.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}改变主意不想和她会面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}changed their minds about meeting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.49,0:44:16.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还指望什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.58,0:44:20.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女人善变 谁要是疯了才会相信她们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Souvent femme varie, bien fol qui s'y fie!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.72,0:44:24.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女人善变 谁要是疯了才会相信她们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}women are often variable. only mad men believe them!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:26.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准确无误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}exactement.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.77,0:44:31.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我考虑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have it in mind, brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.83,0:44:33.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you and i
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.92,0:44:36.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应当商议建立联合十字军的事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should make arrangements for a joint crusade.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.52,0:44:42.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 仿效理查一世 - 完全正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- like... richard coeur de lion! - Absolument
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.81,0:44:45.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Warriors of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.37,0:44:51.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 如果我们重新征服圣地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And of course,no one will be happier than his holiness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.22,0:44:54.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇陛下将会欣喜无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we should commit ourselves to reconquer the holy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.74,0:44:58.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但有一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.07,0:45:02.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将联合领导这次作战 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We would be joint leaders in this venture. yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.89,0:45:07.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.42,0:45:12.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.90,0:45:17.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您重得陛下重用 我深表欣喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm delighted to see you returned to his majesty's good graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.29,0:45:19.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}邀请您和公爵夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It gives me much pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.00,0:45:22.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到加来(法国北部港市)与我们共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To invite you and the duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.82,0:45:25.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我莫大的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To dine with us while we are in calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.89,0:45:28.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能拒绝你的邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not as much pleasure as it gives me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.39,0:45:34.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不胜荣幸 勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To refuse your invitation. my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.11,0:45:41.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有传闻说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are rumours.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.46,0:45:43.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人秘密支持王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That your grace secretly supports the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.90,0:45:46.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反对国王的要事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And are against the king in this great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.79,0:45:49.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而 长久以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet,for so long, you took immense pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.48,0:45:53.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直对阴谋和政治不闻不问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In being totally indifferent to the machinations and politics of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.72,0:45:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.68,0:46:01.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今时不同往日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.96,0:46:21.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波林夫人 重返法国一定很兴奋吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mistress boleyn! you must feel so excited to be back in france,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.92,0:46:23.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟这里有你小小的冒险经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all your little adventures here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.99,0:46:25.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别说了 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tut,mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.79,0:46:29.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该记得我还在为我那可怜的丈夫戴孝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ought to remember that I'm still in mourning for my poor husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:32.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不应该把他叫做可怜人 应该是乏味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well,i wouldn't have called him poor. dull,certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.49,0:46:36.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 而且还不举 - 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And impotent. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.68,0:46:39.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都等不及趁着这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't wait to ride
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.10,0:46:42.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}狂乘一些年轻的法国种马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some young french stallion while I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.73,0:46:47.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}私底下说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well,between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.66,0:46:50.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也迫不及待了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither can i!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.60,0:46:59.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Magnifique!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.19,0:48:11.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's ravishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.63,0:48:23.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.77,0:48:29.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}qui tes vous?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.54,0:48:36.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.09,0:48:50.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原来是美丽的安妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}La belle anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.43,0:49:11.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们姐妹还在法国的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you and your sister were here in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.17,0:49:14.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都期待成为我的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As ladies in wating to my Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.15,0:49:18.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember it so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.01,0:49:20.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下仁慈宽厚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty is very gracious,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.40,0:49:28.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许您知道我的一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but there are some things, perhaps which your majesty knows about me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.02,0:49:37.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望您保密 永不要向国王提起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which I would rather you kept secret, and never mention to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.27,0:49:44.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侯爵夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madame la marquise,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.58,0:49:46.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可是法国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.56,0:49:48.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会泄露女性的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would never betray the secrets of a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.23,0:49:54.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其拥有许多秘密的漂亮女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Especially a beautiful woman, who must naturally have a great many.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.10,0:50:01.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真的支持我和国王的婚姻吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do you really support my marriage to the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.66,0:50:05.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bien 茅videmment. for one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.27,0:50:06.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我讨厌那位君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.84,0:50:09.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何让他痛苦的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that anything which discomforts him,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.28,0:50:11.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸如他的姑姑离婚之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like the divorce of his aunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.60,0:50:14.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}令我欢心鼓舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pleases me immeasurably.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.90,0:50:18.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我知道你与法国是同一阵线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But also,i know you are a friend of france,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.47,0:50:21.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以… 我们可以做交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So... we can do business.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.30,0:50:35.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 但还有别的什么？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- but there is something else? - oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.37,0:50:39.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不应该说这话的 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not my place to say this,madam,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.84,0:50:43.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都这么熟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps we know each other well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.06,0:50:49.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 你要登上的宝座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fact is,the station you will be asked to occupy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.83,0:50:51.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并不那么轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is not an easy one...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.27,0:50:53.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其是对那些并非注定享有宝座的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Especially to those not born to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.27,0:50:57.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想坐拥一切更是举步维艰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is much harder to have everything than to have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.41,0:51:00.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我不是生来就是国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I had not been born to be king,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.18,0:51:06.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定不会希望背负那样的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would certainly not have wished that fate upon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.55,0:51:11.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vous comprenez?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.91,0:51:26.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我明白 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oui,oui,je comprends.majest茅.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.56,0:51:41.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已尽力逃离燃烧我激情的火焰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've tried to run from the fire that burns me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.56,0:51:43.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但当我四处找寻时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But when I look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.80,0:51:46.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}火焰依旧燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There the fire still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.33,0:51:51.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.55,0:51:56.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还记得当时的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you remember how it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.60,0:51:58.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们原来在这的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we were here before
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.78,0:52:02.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有预见到现在的结果 玛莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could you ever have imagined this,mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.34,0:52:05.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何都没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not for all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.36,0:52:09.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有你聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But then I am not as clever as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.07,0:52:13.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.20,0:52:16.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只告诉你一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I can tell only you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.28,0:52:19.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我梦寐以求的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the thing I have so longed for
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.06,0:52:23.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将在这里实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will be accomplished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.28,0:53:20.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为弗兰西斯的表现值得赞赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought francis behaved himself rather admirably.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.45,0:53:27.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You looked beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.09,0:54:40.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now,my love...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.62,0:54:42.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我怀孕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me conceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.53,0:54:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将会生下一个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we will have a son.
